    "id": "29",
    "name": "M\u00f6bius Tidewalk",
    "standout": "A continuous half-twist ribbon creates an inside/outside illusion that changes as viewers walk around it.",
    "scene": "A broad continuous ONE-HALF-TWIST Mobius ribbon sculpture with three parallel mint/cyan LED edge rails and gold illuminated cross-rungs. Its loop rises from low grounded dark supports to a high central twist above a dry-stage wave garden, large open center, visible back side of the ribbon, physically finite. It is an illuminated sculpture, not a public walkable bridge.",
